{
  "prompt": "Infographic visual for a Smart City Management System. A clean, modern design with clear data flow arrows. The visual shows three main inputs: Traffic Management (with a traffic light icon), Waste Management (with a trash bin icon), and Energy Management (with an energy meter icon). Arrows flow from each of these inputs to a central 'Processing' area, represented by a gear icon. From 'Processing,' arrows flow to a 'City Dashboard' with a screen icon. Add small labels: 'User Input' at the top, 'Functions' at the center, and 'City Dashboard' at the bottom. Use a light background and professional colors like teal, blue, and gray for clarity.",
  "size": "large"
}
